 "strings": {
  "That's all I came here to say.": "",
  "Otherwise...": "",
  "See ya.": "",
  "You do you.\nI'm gonna do the right thing.": "",
  "I'm gonna go where my\nconscience takes me. ": "",
  "Don't talk down to me!": "",
  "What self-righteous bullshit!": "",
  "Heh. You might as well\nlet this Mole shit go.": "",
  "You're never gonna find the Mole.": "",
  "Think this is some kind of\nyakuza pissing contest, do you?": "",
  "You think this is just some yakuza dispute?": "",
  "Come on! The Mole is way\nbigger than you know!": "",
  "The Mole is bigger than any of that shit!": "",
  "What do you mean?": "",
  "What's that supposed to mean?": "",
  "You know something.\nI can see it in your eyes.": "",
  "What do you know?\nYou have info that I don't?": "",
  "Hamura trusts you.": "",
  "Did Hamura slip up?": "",
  "Now tell me the damn truth!": "",
  "Tell me everything you know!": "",
  "What about stopping the Mole?\nYou willing to take responsibility for another murder?": "",
  "What if the Mole kills again?\nIt'll be on you if he does!": "",
  "Don't talk like I owe you.": "",
  "Like hell it will.": "",
  "Attorney-client privilege.\nNot like you'd remember it.": "",
  "Besides, remember\nattorney-client privilege? ": "",
  "Go back to school.": "",
  "Go back to law school.": "",
  "Shintani!": "",
  "Well that's no good. I thought you said\nthat you respected that guy, Yagami.": "",
  "Didn't you tell me\nyou respect him as a mentor?": "",
  "All right, I've gotta go.": "",
  "Well, I better get going.": "",
  "Already? You're a busy boy.": "",
  "What, done already?": "",
  "Yeah. Kaito-san?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm good.": "",
  "Yagami and Kaito, yes?\nWhat an honor.": "",
  "Yagami and Kaito, right?": "",
  "Tokyo Police.\nThe name's Kuroiwa.": "",
  "I'm Kuroiwa from Kamurocho PD.": "",
  "Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Kuroiwa?": "",
  "The one who almost put\nHamura behind bars.": "",
  "I'm the one who put Hamura in cuffs...": "",
  "Before you two pulled him\nout of my grasp.": "",
  "...And then you got him acquitted.": "",
  "Heh.": "",
  "Yeeeah.": "",
  "So what?": "",
  "I've become a department punchline now.": "",
  "I'm a department punchline\nthanks to you.": "",
  "I have you to thank.": "",
  "Thanks for that.": "",
  "You're very welcome.": "",
  "And I see you're here, too. Ayabe.": "",
  "You been snuggling up to Ayabe?": "",
  "Oh, Kuroiwa-san!\nNice night. It's great to see you.": "",
  "O-Oh hey, Kuroiwa-san!\nI didn't see you there!": "",
  "Yeah. I cut out of work\nto grab a few drinks.": "",
  "Yeah. I cut out of work to get a drink.": "",
  "You doing the same, Ayabe?": "",
  "You too, Ayabe?": "",
  "Nahhh. Old me?\nI don't play hooky.": "",
  "Ha, yeah right,\nI'd never skip work.": "",
  "Well, we should be on our way.": "",
  "Well, we're on our way out.": "",
  "Hey. Let me ask before you go...": "",
  "Hey... Just tell me one thing.": "",
  "The Okubo case.\nYou let that murderer get off scot-free.": "",
  "Three years ago, you put\na murderer back on the street...": "",
  "After which he burned his\npoor girlfriend to death.": "",
  "And he burned an innocent girl to death.": "",
  "And yet, here we are with another murderer\nroaming the streets of this city.": "",
  "And here we are, another killer\nyou've let off the leash.": "",
  "I wonder who the next\nvictim will be.": "",
  "Who will the next victim be?": "",
  "You consider that. \"Yagami-sensei.\"": "",
  "That's my question...\nYagami-sensei.": "",
  "There he is.": "",
  "That's Murase.": "",
  "Right where I expected.": "",
  "I knew he'd be here.": "",
  "Yeah, not so sure\nit's that simple though.": "",
  "Eh, something's off, though.": "",
  "Take another look.\nMurase's alone.": "",
  "Aren't there fewer mooks than usual?": "",
  "Your point being?": "",
  "You think?": "",
  "Hands up.": "",
  "Don't move.": "",
  "Oh shit...": "",
  "Uh...": "",
  "You know, that Matsugane\nguy died at our hands.": "",
  "We took out a Matsugane Family\nman yesterday.": "",
  "Always knew we'd get some\nTojo Clan boys sent over here.": "",
  "So the Tojo Clan should\ncome knocking any time...": "",
  "So, you see. We've been expecting\nguests this whole time.": "",
  "In other words,\nwe're on high alert at the moment.": "",
  "...Yagami-san.": "",
  "Ideas, Kaito-san?": "",
  "What now, Kaito-san?": "",
  "I, uh...": "",
  "Whaddaya mean?": "",
  "You're the ideas guy, aren't you?": "",
  "You think we've got a choice?": "",
  "Dammit.": "",
  "Guess not.": "",
  "If you two clowns really were Tojo Clan,\nwe'd have gouged your eyes out by now.": "",
  "If you two were Tojo...\nWe'd have gouged your eyes out already.": "",
  "Get the hell on the ground!": "",
  "Get on your knees!": "",
  "Town's sure noisy, huh? No one'll care about,\nsay... a couple of gunshots up here.": "",
  "It's a noisy city...\nA gunshot or two'll hardly make a blip.": "",
  "Whose bright idea was this?": "",
  "Who ordered you here?": "",
  "This guy.": "",
  "Is that really how\nit's gonna be, Kaito-san?": "",
  "So that's how it's gonna be,\nKaito-san...": "",
  "And just who are you?": "",
  "And you are?": "",
  "Good question, \"Kaito-san.\"\nSatoshi Shioya's the name.": "",
  "Captain of the Kyorei Clan.\nThe name's Shioya.": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan's captain, huh?": "",
  "So he's second in command...": "",
  "Higashi mentioned him.": "",
  "Hey. Get some cuffs on these fools.": "",
  "Hey. Gag and cuff 'em.": "",
  "I've got some burning-hot\nquestions to ask 'em.": "",
  "Let's all go get comfy in the office.": "",
  "You ready?\nI think we're gonna have a little fun.": "",
  "You two are in for a long night!": "",
  "You think I'm messin' around!?": "",
  "You think we're playing around!?　": "",
  "Take him out now!": "",
  "Pull the fuckin' trigger!": "",
  "Wha!?": "",
  "Shoot him!": "",
  "Hurry up!": "",
  "The shit!?": "",
  "The fuck!?": "",
  "You...!?": "",
  "Is this really the time?": "",
  "You really have time to think about it?": "",
  "Fair enough.": "",
  "Good point.": "",
  "Come on, let's move!": "",
  "Let's roll, Tak!": "",
  "That's enough.\nCome on. Let's roll.": "",
  "That's enough.\nLet's roll, Tak.": "",
  "Yeah. No reason to stay here.": "",
  "Yeah, let's leave the mess.": "",
  "We owe you one.\nYou should come with us.": "",
  "You saved our asses.\nCome with us.": "",
  "Coming?": "",
  "Sure. May as well.": "",
  "Sure. Why not?": "",
  "Wait— Just like that?": "",
  "Really? Just like that?": "",
  "Hold up.": "",
  "Wait up...　": "",
  "I'm not letting you assholes\nget away that easily...": "",
  "You aren't gettin' off that easy...": "",
  "Yakuza don't fuck around...": "",
  "Yakuza don't mess around...": "",
  "You three are gone.": "",
  "You three are dead.": "",
  "Well shit. You're not half as ugly\nas I figured you were.": "",
  "Shit... You're not half as ugly\nas I thought you'd be.": "",
  "What can I say?": "",
  "That a good idea?": "",
  "You sure about the mask?": "",
  "Well, not like I'll get very far\nwith it on, you know?": "",
  "Doubt we'd get very far\nif I kept it on, man.": "",
  "Okay. Let's go.": "",
  "Cool. Let's go.": "",
  "I haven't been able to reach Shintani-sensei.\nIt keeps going to voicemail.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei isn't\npicking up his phone.": "",
  "He hasn't picked up since he left\nthe office after talking to you.": "",
  "Not since he left after\nyour little chat.": "",
  "Mmhmm. And?": "",
  "Didn't you say the Kyorei Clan\nwas after him?": "",
  "Yeah... He'll be fine.": "",
  "Eh, he'll be fine.　": "",
  "I just wanted to give him a scare.": "",
  "I just wanted to give him\na little scare.": "",
  "Okay, still—\ncould you try him for me?": "",
  "Still... Could you try getting\nhim for me?": "",
  "Sometimes he ignores my calls.\nMaybe he'll pick up for you.": "",
  "He's clearly not going\nto pick up for me.": "",
  "Are you sure we're talking\nabout the same guy?": "",
  "And you think he will for <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>?": "",
  "But I might as well.\nCan't hurt to try.": "",
  "Hi. Shintani here!": "",
  "Hi, this is Shintani!": "",
  "Hey, Shintani-sensei.\nIt's Tak, where are—": "",
  "Shintani-sensei? Where are you right—": "",
  "You've reached the voice mailbox of the one and only\nMasamichi Shintani, Genda Law Office's finest attorney!": "",
  "You've reached the voicemail of Genda Law's\nace attorney, Masamichi Shintani.": "",
  "Shintani...": "",
  "Leave your legal troubles\nafter the beep!": "",
  "Please leave a message!": "",
  "I've heard a bit about\nthis place before...": "",
  "I've heard of this place before...": "",
  "But the ADDC... Isn't it just one\npart of a larger organization?": "",
  "But the ADDC is just one part\nof their group, right?": "",
  "If I recall correctly, they call\nit the Medical Institute... Is that accurate?": "",
  "The Medical Institute,\nI think it was.": "",
  "They own every last inch of this campus.": "",
  "This campus doesn't seem to end.": "",
  "It's incredible.": "",
  "It's not your everyday organization.": "",
  "Even with all these buildings, they're still\ngetting budget to expand from that new drug.": "",
  "On top of all this, they're getting even\nmore budget for that new drug.": "",
  "So? Is it the same as you remember?": "",
  "So, does it look like you remember?": "",
  "Huh? Don't go too far ahead, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hey, wait up, Yagami-san!": "",
  "What're you all shaken up for?": "",
  "What's got you so spooked?": "",
  "Calm down. Just stick with me\nand you'll be fine. Got that, Yagami?": "",
  "Just stick with me, okay?": "",
  "Yagami-san!": "",
  "Yagami-san!　": "",
  "Try not to just ditch me, okay?": "",
  "Geez, don't ditch me like that.": "",
  "Is something wrong?": "",
  "Something wrong?": "",
  "It's just...": "",
  "Nah...": "",
  "After three years,\nit still looks the same.": "",
  "It's like nothing's changed\nin three years.": "",
  "Sorry?": "",
  "Almost like time itself has stopped.": "",
  "Almost like time is frozen here.": "",
  "Yagami-san...": "",
  "Come on.\nFront desk's over there.": "",
  "Come on.\nThere's the front desk.": "",
  "Well... Could I at least talk\nto Director Kido instead?": "",
  "Then, can we talk with Director Kido?": "",
  "He's an old friend of mine.": "",
  "We've met before.": "",
  "Just let him know Yagami\nstopped by to say hello.": "",
  "Tell him I'm a lawyer named Yagami.": "",
  "I don't think that'll\nbe necessary.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. Look.": "",
  "Look over there...": "",
  "Isn't that Kido-san right there?": "",
  "Gentlemen. I really don't know\nwhat else you want from me.": ""
 },
